2052 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1918 0 R
/T (Swiss gaming is extensive: 57% of people \(3.6 million people\) play games and 23% play on a daily basis. Smartphone is the most commonly played device and the demographic is divided by age and gender: men generally play more frequently than women though older women are the most active, and young men \(15-19\) are the most active daily. Language regionally, German speaking Switzerland \(24%\), then French speaking Switzerland \(19%\), then Ticino \(15\) have the highest numbers of daily gaming.)
/E (Swiss gaming is extensive: 57% of people \(3.6 million people\) play games and 23% play on a daily basis. Smartphone is the most commonly played device and the demographic is divided by age and gender: men generally play more frequently than women though older women are the most active, and young men \(15-19\) are the most active daily. Language regionally, German speaking Switzerland \(24%\), then French speaking Switzerland \(19%\), then Ticino \(15\) have the highest numbers of daily gaming.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
