/E (In the case of multilingual behavior, Switzerland is not a monolingual market two-thirds of the population speaks more than one language every day and English is widely spoken throughout the country, particularly among the younger generation. Federal Statistical Office also indicates that 86 percent believe that the knowledge of more than one national language is a factor in cohesion.)
