/T (The Swiss people use approximately one and a half hours per day in travelling and a significant portion of these journeys is in Switzerland; the Swiss also possess a rich culture of using public transport. The likelihood of mobile-play windows is commutes, train rides, waiting times, and brief breaks. The mobility data is giving me the context of gaming, but it is a good fit to the daily life of Swiss people.)
