2102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1920 0 R
/T (The confirmed cleanest benchmark that I identified is the global average gaming-app session length of 30.75 minutes at Adjust in 2024.  An independent benchmark snippet of GameAnalytics indicates that Europe is significantly shorter, at 5.75 minutes per mobile-game session, so session metrics differ a great deal by approach and genre. Frequent short sessions that have a distinct starting point are the safest design assumption, rather than long sessions.)
/E (The confirmed cleanest benchmark that I identified is the global average gaming-app session length of 30.75 minutes at Adjust in 2024.  An independent benchmark snippet of GameAnalytics indicates that Europe is significantly shorter, at 5.75 minutes per mobile-game session, so session metrics differ a great deal by approach and genre. Frequent short sessions that have a distinct starting point are the safest design assumption, rather than long sessions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
