/Title (Roblox It is the number one adventure game on both iPhone and iPad in Switzerland, and the number one adventure on Android in Switzerland, France, and Germany.  What makes it work is the massive user-created world, multiplayer social game, endless new content, and cross-platform access. The combination is abnormally powerful in Switzerland in that it promotes social play, as well as fast drop-in.)
